  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> write height as <strong>5 ft 10 in</strong> or <strong>5&prime;10&Prime;</strong> (feet first, then inches). In sentences, write &ldquo;5 feet 10 inches tall&rdquo;; before a noun, &ldquo;a 5-foot-10 man&rdquo;. In metric, write <strong>178 cm</strong> or <strong>1.78 m</strong>.</p></div>

